<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea's Daehan Flour buys 22,000T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>South Korea's Daehan Flour buys 22,000T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd said on Wednesday it bought 22,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat from Japanese trading house Marubeni Corp.</p>
</text>
